       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MODREM.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 A     PIC S99 VALUE -7.
       01 B     PIC S99 VALUE 3.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "MOD(-7, 3) = " FUNCTION MOD(A B)
           DISPLAY "REM(-7, 3) = " FUNCTION REM(A B)
           DISPLAY "MOD(7, -3) = " FUNCTION MOD(7 -3)
           DISPLAY "INTEGER(-2.5) = " FUNCTION INTEGER(-2.5)
           DISPLAY "INTEGER-PART(-2.5) = " FUNCTION INTEGER-PART(-2.5)
           STOP RUN.
